<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Knights Gold year earnings flat.</title>
<headline>Knights Gold year earnings flat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.2	   vs 3.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   8.57	  vs 8.65</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.22	  vs 0.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		  60.89	 vs 60.86</p>
<p>    Investment income     0.44	  vs 0.71</p>
<p>    Retained profit	 3.48	  vs 8.60</p>
<p>Full name: Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     0.31 loss   vs 0.28 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - The gold mining firm said capital expenditure for the coming year is expected to reduce to about 1.7 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
